      "generatedCopy": "Anthropic has expanded text-watermark coverage to Claude Mythos 5, Opus 4.7, and Sonnet 4.6. The operational detail matters more than the headline: Bedrock rollout timing and Sonnet 4.6 sampling settings can change whether a mark is expected.\n\nI turned the release into a practical provenance audit with a generation receipt, four-state expectation classifier, transformation lineage, and fail-closed wording rules. A missing mark is not proof of human authorship, and the detector is still Private Preview.\n\nRead the bilingual checklist: https://indieseek.co/blogs/claude-text-watermark-model-platform-sampling-audit-checklist/?utm_source=linkedin&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=claude-text-watermark-model-platform-sampling-audit-checklist",
